    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "f1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will I receive my order?",
            "content": "<p>We dispatch within 24 hours on working days. Delivery takes 3-6 days, tracked from the moment your order leaves our warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How warm is this jacket?",
            "content": "<p>Want the exact fill, weight and temperature range before you order? Write to us and our team will send them to you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which size should I choose?",
            "content": "<p>Our jackets have a regular fit with room for a mid-layer. Between two sizes, take the larger one if you layer heavily. Measurements for each size are in the size guide.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I return or exchange my jacket?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. You have 30 days to return or exchange any unworn item with its tags. Returns are free and you get a full refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do Black Friday prices work?",
            "content": "<p>The discount is already applied to the price shown on the product page, and the countdown shows exactly when the offer ends. When a discount code is mentioned, it is applied automatically at checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is my payment secure?",
            "content": "<p>Every payment runs through Shopify's encrypted checkout. We never see or store your card details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it safe to order here?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Payment goes through Shopify’s encrypted checkout: we never see or store your card details. You get an order confirmation by email, then a tracking link as soon as your jacket ships. And if it isn’t right, you have 30 days to send it back for a full refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will I get a tracking number?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. As soon as your order ships, you receive an email with your tracking link, so you can follow your jacket all the way to your door.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
